      - WindowType
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 1
      debugIndex: 1
      strings:
      - 
      - Abe Normale
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 1945, a bleak December.
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 2
      debugIndex: 2
      strings:
      - 
      - Abe Normale
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - The kind that makes you weak and weary, wanting to nod, nearly napping. My only companion was the empty bottle at my side.
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 3
      debugIndex: 3
      strings:
      - 
      - Abe Normale
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - With all of its life drained, I see no other choice but to press on. A murder happened in this hotel a few weeks ago, but has since gone unsolved.
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 4
      debugIndex: 4
      strings:
      - 
      - Abe Normale
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - "Our boys in blue deferred to me, claiming something about the hotel being haunted. I don\u2019t believe in ghosts, but I also didn\u2019t believe that my bottle could run dry until five minutes ago."
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    name: Assets/FemmeFatale/Scenarios/FemmeFatale.xls:IntroCutscene
    type: 1
    textLength: 589
    headerRow: 0
    sourceAssetInEditor: {fileID: 102900000, guid: 5edbe1e9889507740a86b18eaf060779, type: 3}
    entityIndexTbl: 
    entityDataList: []
  - rows:
    - rowIndex: 0
      debugIndex: 0
      strings:
      - Command
      - Arg1
      - Arg2
      - Arg3
      - Arg4
      - Arg5
      - Arg6
      - WaitType
      - Text
      - PageCtrl
      - Voice
      - WindowType
      isEmpty: 0
