      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 1
      debugIndex: 1
      strings:
      - Bg
      - TempLobby
      - 
      - 
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 2
      debugIndex: 2
      strings:
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - "I\u2019m starting to feel watched."
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 3
      debugIndex: 3
      strings:
      - 
      - Eyeris
      - Neutral
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - Well, well. What have we here? Let me take a good look at you.
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 4
      debugIndex: 4
      strings:
      - Selection
      - '*LookingIsNoCrime'
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - Looking isn't a crime. (Yes)
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 5
      debugIndex: 5
      strings:
      - Selection
      - '*NotAfraidToUseFlashlight'
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - I've got a flashlight and I'm not afraid to use it! (No)
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 6
      debugIndex: 7
      strings:
      - '*LookingIsNoCrime'
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 7
      debugIndex: 8
      strings:
      - 
      - Eyeris
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 'How cooperative, for such a little human! '
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 8
      debugIndex: 9
      strings:
      - 
      - Eyeris
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - "You know, why don\u2019t I have you for dinner?"
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 9
      debugIndex: 10
      strings:
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - "I get the feeling she\u2019s talking about some steak. She\u2019s got good taste."
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 10
      debugIndex: 11
      strings:
      - EndScenario
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 11
      debugIndex: 12
      strings:
      - '*NotAfraidToUseFlashlight'
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 12
      debugIndex: 13
      strings:
      - 
      - Eyeris
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - Put that thing away, you wretch!
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 13
      debugIndex: 14
      strings:
      - 
      - Eyeris
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - "Be a gentleman now, don\u2019t hurt this lady\u2019s eyes. You\u2019ll give me a headache."
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
    - rowIndex: 14
      debugIndex: 15
      strings:
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - "A woman who drowns herself in booze until she\u2019s hungover till the next night. I\u2019ve found myself in many a bind like that, too."
      isEmpty: 0
      isCommentOut: 0
      debugInfo: 
